<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoTokenCreateEndOfInput"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoTokenCreateEndOfInput</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoTokenCreateEndOfInput</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to create a token indicating the end of
    input</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Token.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoToken *SilikoTokenCreateEndOfInput(void);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoTokenCreateEndOfInput</function> function
creates a new <type>SilikoToken</type> representing the ind of
input.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoTokenCreateEndOfInput</function> returns a
pointer to the newly created <type>SilikoToken</type> object if
successful, or <literal>NULL</literal> on failure.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
